          <ul class="list-check">
            <li>Cold-climate rated units</li>
            <li>Load calcs & duct design</li>
            <li>Rebates & incentives help</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-3"><a class="btn" href="/book.html">Book Heat Pump</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Ductless Mini-Splits</h3>
          <p>Room-by-room control with sleek indoor units. Perfect for additions and homes without ducts.</p>
          <ul class="list-check">
            <li>Multi-zone configurations</li>
            <li>Wall, floor, ceiling cassettes</li>
            <li>Low-temperature performance</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-3"><a class="btn" href="/book.html">Book Ductless</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Indoor Air Quality</h3>
          <p>Breathe better with advanced filtration, purification, and ventilation strategies.</p>
          <ul class="list-check">
            <li>MERV/HEPA filtration</li>
            <li>UV-C & bipolar ionization</li>
            <li>ERV/HRV ventilation</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-3"><a class="btn" href="/book.html">Improve Air Quality</a></div>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3>Maintenance Plans</h3>
          <p>Prevent breakdowns and extend equipment life. Priority scheduling and member discounts.</p>
          <ul class="list-check">
            <li>Seasonal tune-ups</li>
            <li>15% off parts & labor</li>
            <li>Priority response</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="mt-3"><a class="btn" href="/pricing.html#plans">View Plans</a></div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-6">
        <h2>FAQs</h2>
