              <p>In most cases we arrive same-day in {{CITY}} and within 24 hours for surrounding areas. Emergency dispatch is available 24/7.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="acc-item">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">Do you service all brands?<span>+</span></button>
            <div class="acc-panel" hidden>
              <p>Yes—our certified technicians repair and maintain all major HVAC brands and models.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="acc-item">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">Are estimates free?<span>+</span></button>
