{"path":"financing.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Financing | {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Flexible HVAC financing from {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. Instant decisions, competitive APRs, and no prepayment penalties.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#2bb3ff">
  <meta property="og:type" content="article">
  <meta property="og:title" content="HVAC Financing — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}">
  <meta property="og:description" content="Upgrade now, pay over time with options from 6–72 months.">
  <meta property="og:image" content="/assets/img/hero-abstract.svg">
  <meta property="og:url" content="/financing.html">
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="topbar"><div class="container wrap"><span class="badge">Open: {{HOURS}}</span><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a></div></div>
  <header class="header"><div class="container nav">
    <a class="brand" href="/index.html"><span class="logo"></span><span>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}<small>{{TAGLINE}}</small></span></a>
    <nav class="navlinks" id="mainmenu" aria-label="Main">
      <a href="/index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="/services.html">Services</a>
      <a href="/pricing.html">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/financing.html" aria-current="page">Financing</a>
      <a href="/about.html">About</a>
      <a href="/reviews.html">Reviews</a>
      <a href="/book.html">Book</a>
      <a href="/contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="nav-cta"><a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a><button class="menu-btn" aria-controls="mainmenu" aria-expanded="false">Menu</button></div>
  </div></header>

  <main class="section">
    <div class="container grid" style="grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; align-items:start;">
      <div>
        <h1>Financing Options</h1>
        <p class="lead">Get the comfort you deserve today with low monthly payments. Quick approvals, clear terms, and no prepayment penalties.</p>

        <div class="grid mt-3" style="grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);">
          <div class="card"><h3>6–24 mo</h3><p class="help">Promotional APRs on smaller projects.</p><ul class="list-check"><li>Instant decision</li><li>Low fixed payments</li><li>No early payoff fee</li></ul></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>36–48 mo</h3><p class="help">Balanced term for equipment upgrades.</p><ul class="list-check"><li>Competitive rates</li><li>AutoPay available</li><li>Bundle add-ons</li></ul></div>
          <div class="card"><h3>60–72 mo</h3><p class="help">Lowest monthly payments for full systems.</p><ul class="list-check"><li>Predictable budgeting</li><li>Extended warranties</li><li>High approval odds</li></ul></div>
        </div>

        <div class="accordion mt-6">
          <div class="acc-item">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">Will financing affect my credit score?<span>+</span></button>
            <div class="acc-panel" hidden><p>Most partners use a soft credit check for pre-qualification, which does not impact your score. A hard inquiry may occur upon final funding.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div class="acc-item">
            <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false">Can I pay off early?<span>+</span></button>
            <div class="acc-panel" hidden><p>Yes. There are no prepayment penalties—pay off anytime and save on interest.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card mt-6">
          <div class="row">
            <div>
              <h3 class="m-0">Prefer to talk it through?</h3>
              <p class="help mt-2">Our advisors will walk you through terms in plain language.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space"></div>
            <a class="btn" href="tel:{{PHONE}}">Call {{PHONE}}</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card" aria-labelledby="calc-title">
        <h2 id="calc-title">Monthly Payment Calculator</h2>
